# Local Artifact Protection

- Treat `.exo_data/` and `.coverage` as protected local artifacts.
- Never delete, reset, or clean these paths unless the user gives explicit confirmation in the current conversation.
- Before any cleanup command, list targeted paths and ask for approval when either protected path is included.
- If either path was removed accidentally, acknowledge clearly and restore baseline state (`.exo_data/` + `exo.db`, `.coverage`) immediately.
